  partName: Cylinder Head Bolt (3)
  description: The Cylinder Head Bolt (3) is a tiny, complex-shaped fastener situated
    at the top-center-center of the engine, constructed from Material.001. As part
    of the cylinder head fastening system, it helps to maintain a secure connection
    between the cylinder head and engine block, allowing for smooth engine operation.
    One interesting aspect of this bolt is its ability to withstand high thermal
    stresses, ensuring a reliable seal even in extreme operating conditions.
